sycl: NVFP4 in the grouped MoE GEMMs, and UE4M3 / E2M1 decoding from bits

HomeBrain patch on ggml-sycl. Applies on top of 0004.
Upstream PR: https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/32981 (this patch is its commit)

The former 0005, 0009 and 0014 in one patch, as submitted upstream. Prefill
MUL_MAT_ID with NVFP4 experts takes the XMX joint_matrix and the ESIMD
grouped GEMMs instead of the per-expert loop, and the MoE mat-vec decodes
the UE4M3 scales and E2M1 codes from bits instead of pow() and table
lookups. B60, 128 experts top-8, test-backend-ops perf: 82.7 -> 23.4 us at
1 token, 4630 -> 1278 us at 512.

